0.4.1 [2026-05-20]

- omit `title` from parsed ISSN-L output for current portal JSON-LD
- keep `title` in parsed ISSN-L output for legacy graph payloads only
- update README to list ISSN-L parsed fields as id, related
- add regression test for compact ISSN-L JSON-LD without name/title

0.4.0 [2026-05-19]

- add opt-in legacy mode using the publishers.issn.org `?format=json` endpoint
- add `--legacy` flag to the ISSN and ISSN-L console scripts
- thread `legacy` through client.request, record, record_link and find_link
- skip the current portal endpoint in legacy ISSN-L link validation
- expose `publisher` in parsed ISSN output in legacy mode only
- add regression tests for legacy URL selection and graph parsing

0.3.0 [2026-03-24]

- adapt ISSN and ISSN-L retrieval to current portal JSON-LD endpoints
- add fallback content negotiation via `Accept: application/ld+json`
- support both legacy `@graph` and compact JSON-LD payloads in parsers
- normalize medium and record status values in parsed output
- add regression tests for portal compatibility

0.2.0 [2024-12-08]

- switch from setup.py to pyproject.toml
- add method get_publisher to ParserIssn

